  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-项目管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"本接口支持批量查询项目的成本保障状态及相关赔付信息（接口能力仅对齐巨量营销升级版），需传入巨量营销平台客户id和项目id列表，注意仅允许传入投放账户下存在的project_id。应答中会返回项目成本保障信息列表，包括状态、失效原因、结束原因、赔付金额、赔付规则链接等。\",\"id\":\"marketing.project.cost_protect_status.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/project/cost_protect_status/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1802842544128000\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"marketing.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求本接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"marketing.return_code.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"本接口应答中的返回码和返回信息需要参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录 - 返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1802842544128000\",\"title\":\"批量获取项目成本保障状态\"}",
